flowchart TD
  R[Integrity run, export or prune] --> L[App takes its anchor lock]
  L --> Q{Signer configured?}
  Q -- yes --> S[Signer: checks the chain follows its last verified anchor, signs the tip]
  Q -- no --> K[App signs with its own key]
  S --> F[Anchor file, log line, optional webhook]
  K --> F
  F --> V[Each run: last anchor held to the database; each window: every anchor judged]
